<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_IV__cl_21> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "21" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
