<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_6__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_6__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
