<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "40" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://schema.org/name> "Walau apa pun mana-mana undang-undang bertulis yang lain—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
