<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam mana-mana prosiding sivil oleh atau terhadap Lembaga; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/msa@> .
